      "writtenOn": "2025-01-08T01:48:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Daniel,\n\nUSB Power Delivery Specification R3.2 V1.1, Section 6.4.4.3.4 Enter Mode Command\n\n\n\u003e The Number of Data Objects field in the Command response Shall be set to 1 since an Enter Mode Command response (ACK, NAK) Shall Not contain any VDOs.\n\n\nThe number 1 is necessary because the response object counts the header object.",
      "parentUuid": "aa9b167e_accbe3c5",
